{#
/**
 * @file
 * Results partial.
 * This template defines the results section of the individual reflection page, 
 * providing a summary of the respondent's performance across each indicator.
 * 
 * It is populated using the populateResults function in recommender.js, which 
 * generates personalized course recommendations based on the respondent's answers 
 * to the questionnaire.
 */
#}
<section id='results-section'>
    <div id='results-introduction'>
        <h2>Recommended Digital Fluency Trainings in HRMS LEARN</h2>
        <p>Thank you for completing the Digital Fluency individual reflection questionnaire. The recommendations listed below are based on your responses. If you would like to access these recommendations at a later date, be sure to save them.</p>
        <p>For each Indicator, the results will reflect the levels of ability that would be most appropriate based on your responses to the questionnaire. Below the levels, you will see a list of recommended sub-topics. The sub-topics correspond to the training categories for each Indicator  in HRMS LEARN.</p>
        <p>You are always encouraged to review and explore the Digital Fluency offerings in HRMS LEARN as you prefer. These recommendations are intended as a starting point.</p>
        <p>Questions and feedback about the questionnaire and the list of recommendations can be directed via email to <a href="mailto:digitalfluency@humber.ca">digitalfluency@humber.ca</a>.</p>
        <p>
            <strong>Note:</strong> This questionnaire is completely private and no identifying information is captured. 
        </p>
    </div>

    {% for indicator in indicators %}
        <div class='indicator-div indicator-{{ loop.index }}-div'>
            <h3>{{ indicator.title }}</h3>
            <p class='indicator-empty is-visible'>You have no courses recommended to you for this indicator.</p>
            {% for level in ['competent', 'proficient', 'leader'] %}
                <div class='course-competency {{ level }}'>
                    <h4 class='competency-title'>{{ level|capitalize }}</h4>
                    <p>
                        Open the course "{{ indicator.title | replace({':': ' (' ~ level|capitalize ~ '):'}) }}"
                    </p>
                    <p>Complete all activities in the following sections:</p>
                    <ol class='course-sections'></ol>
                </div>
            {% endfor %}
        </div>
    {% endfor %}

    {# Include instructions partial #}
    {% include '@individual_reflection/templates/partials/instructions.html.twig' %}
</section>